WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:01.770
- Buy me some ice cream?

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:03.630
Well, you know I struggle with dairy.

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.637
- That's because you hold it in, Mom.

00:00:05.637 --> 00:00:06.780
You just gotta let it rip.

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:07.980
Everybody farts.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.330
- I don't.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.590
- Why would you torture yourself?

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:12.810
Just eat some ice cream.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.220
Live in your body.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.980
Oh, I literally have no pores.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.480
- Mom, check out your biscuit.

00:00:19.344 --> 00:00:21.424
Who knew you were such a big booty Judy.

00:00:21.424 --> 00:00:22.702
- CC.

00:00:22.702 --> 00:00:24.600
(playful music)

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.760
CC Walker, you have a tattoo?

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.080
Oh, absolutely not, CC.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.790
- No, no, you cannot wear that to school.

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:30.668
I will die.

00:00:30.668 --> 00:00:31.501
- Do you think you're
wearing this to my work?

00:00:31.501 --> 00:00:32.730
- You look like an American Girl Doll.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.380
- Are those your father's gym shorts?

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.730
- Is this Nancy Pelosi?

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:37.140
- You have paint on your jacket!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.540
- Yeah, you gotta bow down to
the patriarchy, don't ya, Mom?

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.370
Just dress for the male gaze.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:42.960
- Oh, you and your ideals.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:43.860
Well, let me tell you something.

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:45.235
Ideals don't pay the bills.

00:00:45.235 --> 00:00:47.790
(burping)

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.500
Oh, CC, what did you eat?

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.293
- Sorry, I pounded a Gatorade
on the way over here.

00:00:52.293 --> 00:00:54.704
♪ Let's do it ♪
- Okay.

00:00:54.704 --> 00:00:55.800
♪ Ride it ♪
- No, no, Mom!

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:56.953
Mom!
- Ride my pony.

00:00:56.953 --> 00:00:57.786
- We don't do that.

00:00:57.786 --> 00:00:58.619
Thank you, guy.

00:00:58.619 --> 00:00:59.970
- I can't believe I thought
we could pull this off.

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:01.793
- Yeah, what happened
to "Miss I Got This"?

00:01:01.793 --> 00:01:03.300
- Well, you fell down the steps, Mom.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:04.680
Oh, it's so bad.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:05.910
I don't think I can hold it in.

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:06.810
- Oh, yes you can.

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:07.650
You wanna know why?

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.480
There are 40 years of
farts in that stomach.

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.500
You will not let them out

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.390
on the most important day of my career.

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:13.232
- I don't wanna let 'em out.

00:01:13.232 --> 00:01:14.070
I don't wanna let 'em out.
- Just breathe.

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.260
- You don't really care about me

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.720
and about what actually makes me happy.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.550
You just want me to be like you,

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:22.733
and think like you, and act like you.

00:01:23.973 --> 00:01:25.713
It's not about the national team.

00:01:27.707 --> 00:01:29.667
I just wanna get away from you.

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:30.686
♪ Just bust a move ♪

00:01:30.686 --> 00:01:32.326
This is absolutely unacceptable.

00:01:32.326 --> 00:01:34.410
- I can explain.
- You can explain?

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:35.243
- I'm having fun.

00:01:35.243 --> 00:01:36.720
Can you not just be happy for your mother?

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:38.435
- Moms don't dance like this.

00:01:38.435 --> 00:01:39.744
♪ Just bust a move ♪

00:01:39.744 --> 00:01:40.577
- I'm having fun.

00:01:40.577 --> 00:01:42.240
You have fun in my body.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.763
- For the rest of the
time you are in this body,

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:46.523
you're grounded.

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:50.940
But I am here stuck in this
hag body and you're just out

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:54.510
while I have your stupid friends
and your psycho dog baby.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.070
- Is me having fun the problem?

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:59.070
Because I thought the
problem was me being a robot.

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:00.420
(Jess scoffs)
I am Jess Walker.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:02.430
Your criticism does not compute.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:04.590
- I'm sorry, Mom.
- No, no, CC.

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:07.290
- I didn't understand
how hard your job is.

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:08.817
And everything you do for our family.

00:02:08.817 --> 00:02:10.053
- No, no, CC.

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:13.020
I'm the one who's sorry.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:14.400
You were right, honey.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.540
Your way works for you.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:18.040
And it doesn't have to be
my way to be a good way.

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:22.830
More than anything in this entire world,

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.780
I just want you to be okay.

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:26.600
- I will be okay

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.020
'cause I have the best mom in the world

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.470
and that's how she raised me.

00:02:30.385 --> 00:02:34.260
(both sniffling)
(tender music)

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:36.270
- We're looking for two
things in our players.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.220
Good soccer, good character.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:39.420
I've seen your tapes.

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.980
I knew you're a great soccer player.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:43.530
When I saw you give up a game winning goal

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.680
to help an injured opponents,
I knew you had both.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.513
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:51.360
Can you just hold on for one second?

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.290
Hey, Mom?

00:02:54.523 --> 00:02:56.523
- [Jess] It's a miracle.

00:02:58.163 --> 00:02:59.850
- This is the rep from the national team.

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:02.340
He just offered me another chance.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:03.993
But I'm saying no, right?

00:03:04.982 --> 00:03:06.632
- Wait.

00:03:06.632 --> 00:03:07.770
No.
- Right.

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.230
I'm so sorry.
- No, we're saying yes.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:11.820
You have to say yes.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:14.343
And look, if soccer is the thing you love,

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:16.850
I'll be at every game.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.163
- Really?

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.960
- Try and stop me.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:22.865
- Thank you!

00:03:22.865 --> 00:03:26.043
(uplifting music)

